WEBVTT

01:00.390 --> 01:07.220
It is said that 70% of the
human brain's capacity is unused.

01:09.230 --> 01:11.290
It's also thought that...

01:11.860 --> 01:15.060
...the mysterious powers that humans
have are hidden in this part of the brain.

01:17.000 --> 01:21.560
The 70% of the brain that is not used...

01:22.340 --> 01:24.070
...is often called this...

01:24.140 --> 01:29.880
<i>Night Head Genesis</i>

01:30.650 --> 01:31.380
No!

01:31.450 --> 01:32.250
Leave!

01:32.320 --> 01:33.220
We'll kill you!

01:33.720 --> 01:35.480
You can do it!

01:35.620 --> 01:37.590
This is where you two grew up!

01:37.660 --> 01:40.490
You should be able to
synchronize with the frequency.

01:45.830 --> 01:46.760
Brother!

01:51.740 --> 01:52.640
Damn it.

01:53.740 --> 01:55.760
Mikuriya, this is farewell.

01:56.280 --> 01:59.140
Once we leave here,
we'll never see you again.

02:15.460 --> 02:16.990
They're saying to get out.

02:19.030 --> 02:20.260
It's a fight.

02:21.030 --> 02:22.000
Yeah.

02:29.680 --> 02:30.980
<i>Surge</i>

02:30.980 --> 02:34.740
<i>Surge
Episode 15</i>

03:55.900 --> 03:57.490
It's just a point.

03:59.270 --> 04:02.000
I was just thinking about
humans the whole time.

04:03.440 --> 04:06.700
Where did humans come from
and where do they go?

04:07.640 --> 04:10.800
I just wanted to
understand the big flow.

04:11.580 --> 04:16.640
Also if there was any way
to lead that flow in a better way...

04:16.980 --> 04:19.380
That was the kind of dream
I was thinking of.

04:20.320 --> 04:23.950
But, I was only a point too.

04:24.620 --> 04:26.560
Just like everyone else's life...

04:26.630 --> 04:32.120
...my life was also only a second
of blinking in the eyes of history.

04:36.900 --> 04:39.870
But even if it's only a point...

04:40.410 --> 04:44.340
Even if there is no meaning
and it's only a couple of steps.

04:44.810 --> 04:47.540
I'm going to keep on moving forward.

04:52.790 --> 04:56.740
You dragged us into
this dispute with your ego.

04:57.190 --> 04:59.890
I don't want to hear your view of life!

06:03.820 --> 06:05.020
What's wrong, Naoya?

06:05.760 --> 06:06.520
Naoya!

06:08.160 --> 06:10.390
They have incredible power.

06:10.600 --> 06:11.820
There's no way...

06:11.900 --> 06:13.590
There's no way we can match them.

06:13.670 --> 06:15.000
That's not true!

06:16.340 --> 06:17.460
It's impossible.

06:17.600 --> 06:19.070
We can't go farther than this.

06:19.140 --> 06:20.260
What are you saying?

06:20.340 --> 06:22.500
Let's go.
We have to keep on moving!

06:37.190 --> 06:41.130
If we leave Mr. Mikuriya,
they will save...

06:41.460 --> 06:43.430
Don't listen! It's just a threat!

06:55.940 --> 06:56.840
Naoya...

06:59.510 --> 07:01.040
We have to go...

07:01.380 --> 07:02.310
Shut up!

07:16.960 --> 07:18.400
Please take me.

07:19.430 --> 07:20.960
Please get me...

07:21.870 --> 07:23.730
...out of here.

07:24.740 --> 07:27.200
I beg you.
Please don't leave me here.

07:33.210 --> 07:35.310
You guys grew up here.

07:36.150 --> 07:38.740
Raised by the surge of this forest...

07:39.920 --> 07:44.050
If it's you two,
you can find the frequency.

07:52.530 --> 07:53.960
Brother...

08:00.240 --> 08:02.970
This world is filled with unbalances.

08:03.680 --> 08:05.540
Wars, hunger...

08:06.040 --> 08:07.710
If people wanted to...

08:07.780 --> 08:11.840
...they have the power to turn
the world around to the better way.

08:12.150 --> 08:16.140
But this abnormal distortion does not
improve at all even when time passes on.

08:17.290 --> 08:20.220
Compared to other living creatures...

08:20.290 --> 08:25.460
...the brain of a human is way too big
compared to the volume of the body.

08:26.400 --> 08:29.800
But, regardless of how much
of a genius any human is...

08:29.870 --> 08:32.600
...they don't use even
30% of their brains.

08:33.240 --> 08:36.260
In recent years, there have been
theories saying it's 5%.

08:37.110 --> 08:40.670
Then for what reason
is the rest of it there for?

08:45.880 --> 08:50.220
There are other theories saying that
mankind migrated from another planet.

08:50.320 --> 08:54.690
Then of course the standard doesn't
match with Earth's environment.

08:55.230 --> 08:59.320
Maybe in the future, the Earth's
environment is going to change, and...

08:59.430 --> 09:03.130
...mankind is going to use
the rest of the parts.

09:03.840 --> 09:08.140
It's definite that your powers
are associated with that part.

09:08.510 --> 09:12.530
It's difficult to clarify
what is functioning and how.

09:13.750 --> 09:17.010
The world of the brain and
consciousness is filled with mysteries.

09:18.580 --> 09:22.450
Elder Misaki told me
about Shouko's existence.

09:24.020 --> 09:26.080
You knew about Shouko?

09:27.130 --> 09:31.320
He said there is no need
to bring Shouko here.

09:31.860 --> 09:34.020
Shouko's power was also large.

09:34.500 --> 09:37.760
To the point that she would
lose her body right away.

09:38.600 --> 09:42.010
He said she would become
an existence of consciousness...

09:42.070 --> 09:44.740
...and help those that have powers.

09:47.650 --> 09:49.480
Those guys are listening too.

09:52.350 --> 09:55.380
If our powers keep on growing,
does that mean...

09:55.450 --> 09:58.860
...there is a chance
we will become like Shouko too?

09:59.860 --> 10:02.520
If you guys wish for it.

10:03.230 --> 10:06.460
Are you saying that Shouko
wished for that to happen?

10:06.730 --> 10:08.060
That might be.

10:09.430 --> 10:14.430
If humans were able to use
the rest of the 70% of the brain...

10:14.510 --> 10:15.770
...what would happen?

10:15.840 --> 10:17.000
What would happen?

10:19.110 --> 10:21.270
Failure of the body would occur.

10:21.480 --> 10:23.970
I don't know how
the failure will occur.

10:24.950 --> 10:27.350
Maybe at the point it passes 30%...

10:27.420 --> 10:30.180
...the mind that was
confined in the brain...

10:30.260 --> 10:33.710
...may become an existence
that is unrelated to the body.

10:35.790 --> 10:37.420
You mean like Shouko?

10:55.650 --> 10:56.770
That's right.

10:57.180 --> 10:59.740
When I think about it, I pity Shouko.

10:59.990 --> 11:01.180
That's enough.

11:01.450 --> 11:03.050
That's the end of talking.

11:09.330 --> 11:10.260
Brother...

11:28.510 --> 11:30.310
This place is an energy spot!

11:30.380 --> 11:31.640
You guys can win!

11:41.490 --> 11:42.260
Brother!

11:50.340 --> 11:54.000
Concentrate your conscious mind!
Feel the frequency of this place!

12:07.550 --> 12:08.540
Brother!

12:18.960 --> 12:21.490
They are gathering the power.

12:31.140 --> 12:33.740
The three of them
are gathering their powers.

12:56.700 --> 12:58.460
Brother, it's coming.

13:20.090 --> 13:21.390
N-Naoya...

13:43.820 --> 13:45.080
Mr. Misaki...

14:09.640 --> 14:10.770
The wall...

14:13.510 --> 14:14.440
What is it?

14:14.910 --> 14:16.010
The wall!

14:17.050 --> 14:18.710
Remove the wall...

14:19.150 --> 14:20.140
The wall?

14:20.650 --> 14:23.520
Remove the wall of the heart.

14:24.760 --> 14:26.090
Do not fear...

14:27.330 --> 14:31.630
Do not fear the true
appearance of yourself.

14:32.860 --> 14:34.060
Accept it...

14:51.720 --> 14:53.120
The wall of the heart.

14:58.790 --> 15:00.520
The forest's frequency.

15:02.130 --> 15:03.030
The wall.

16:03.420 --> 16:04.550
Brother...

16:04.690 --> 16:05.620
Naoya...

16:35.920 --> 16:37.410
It's the power of the forest.

16:37.890 --> 16:38.950
The forest's?

16:40.330 --> 16:47.030
You two will soon be able to
control your powers completely.

16:47.630 --> 16:50.000
Even if it's not an energy spot...

16:51.140 --> 16:54.500
You two have grown.

17:14.960 --> 17:16.290
This is Nishikido.

17:16.390 --> 17:18.490
It's about that trial.

17:19.000 --> 17:20.360
Did you find something out?

17:20.970 --> 17:23.830
It's definite that the
judge committed suicide.

17:23.900 --> 17:25.960
It's impossible to overturn it.

17:26.200 --> 17:27.640
Is that so...

17:29.310 --> 17:30.800
And what else?

17:31.010 --> 17:33.810
I forwarded you the
video footage that was recorded...

17:33.880 --> 17:35.610
...on the security camera
of the courthouse.

17:35.680 --> 17:37.170
Please watch it.

17:37.250 --> 17:38.480
That's it.

17:48.360 --> 17:49.590
Sonezaki!

17:55.300 --> 17:56.270
What is it?

17:56.670 --> 17:59.360
A person named Mr. Mikuriya
is saying he would like to see you.

18:01.570 --> 18:02.700
Let him through.

18:11.580 --> 18:12.780
Mr. Mikuriya.

18:13.690 --> 18:14.550
Hi.

18:14.950 --> 18:17.220
I'm glad. You're alive.

18:17.620 --> 18:18.420
Yeah.

18:18.660 --> 18:19.990
Long time no see.

18:23.900 --> 18:25.390
What happened?

18:27.100 --> 18:30.800
I couldn't get a hold of you
all of a sudden, so I was worried.

18:32.870 --> 18:35.740
I came today to pick up the item.

18:37.440 --> 18:39.740
Are you planning to
not tell me anything?

18:40.350 --> 18:42.250
I don't want to hassle you.

18:44.080 --> 18:46.740
I am going to leave Japan.

18:46.820 --> 18:47.410
What?

18:50.820 --> 18:54.850
I will most likely not
come back to Japan until I die.

18:58.100 --> 18:59.460
This is good-bye.

19:00.060 --> 19:01.290
I understand.

19:09.170 --> 19:10.300
Thank you.

19:14.150 --> 19:16.440
The one that was investing
in the research lab was...

19:16.510 --> 19:18.140
...a member of congress
from the conservation faction.

19:18.220 --> 19:19.810
Don't say more than that.

19:19.880 --> 19:21.410
Your life would be in danger.

19:21.490 --> 19:25.050
What happened between
that person and Elder Misaki?

19:25.520 --> 19:29.550
Mr. Misaki wouldn't
even tell me about it.

19:30.160 --> 19:33.650
Also, that member of congress
passed away last year.

19:34.970 --> 19:38.130
A good amount of inheritance
went to the research lab.

19:38.670 --> 19:40.540
Please forget about everything.

19:40.740 --> 19:42.540
As if nothing happened...

19:43.640 --> 19:45.370
About Sonezaki too...

19:47.480 --> 19:49.640
I am happy I got to know you.

20:05.060 --> 20:06.290
Sorry to make you wait.

20:09.330 --> 20:10.700
Take this with you.

20:13.270 --> 20:14.300
Money?

20:14.540 --> 20:16.630
Yeah, it's an equal split.

20:27.190 --> 20:28.240
You're not getting on?

20:28.650 --> 20:30.590
Yeah, I'm done.

20:30.660 --> 20:31.550
Go.

20:32.920 --> 20:34.050
Mr. Mikuriya...

20:37.030 --> 20:38.520
Please don't touch me.

20:38.800 --> 20:39.790
I beg you.

20:43.970 --> 20:45.060
Mikuriya...

21:13.900 --> 21:16.960
If our powers keep on growing...

21:17.040 --> 21:20.370
...does that mean there is a chance
we will become like Shouko too?

21:21.710 --> 21:24.500
If you guys wish for it.

21:25.080 --> 21:28.200
Are you saying that Shouko
wished for that to happen?

21:28.550 --> 21:29.570
That might be.

21:31.280 --> 21:36.190
If humans were able to use
the rest of the 70% of the brain...

21:36.390 --> 21:37.650
...what would happen?

21:40.560 --> 21:42.580
Failure of the body would occur.

21:42.890 --> 21:45.560
I don't know how
the failure will occur.

21:46.400 --> 21:48.760
Maybe at the point it passes 30%...

21:48.830 --> 21:51.630
...the mind that was
confined in the brain...

21:51.700 --> 21:55.260
...may become an existence
that is unrelated to the body.

21:57.340 --> 21:58.970
Just like Shouko, huh?

22:08.390 --> 22:09.610
Brother...

22:10.960 --> 22:13.250
Something is wrong with my body.

22:14.690 --> 22:15.390
Naoya!

22:15.460 --> 22:16.590
Brother!

22:18.300 --> 22:19.230
Naoya!

22:31.240 --> 22:34.510
<i>An exact answer is nowhere.</i>

22:34.580 --> 22:37.170
<i>Even if you corner it, it still runs.</i>

22:37.250 --> 22:41.840
<i>It's that kind of repeating all the time.</i>

22:41.920 --> 22:45.150
<i>We hurt each other
and rip each other apart.</i>

22:45.220 --> 22:47.850
<i>We're complaining once again.</i>

22:47.930 --> 22:53.260
<i>When tomorrow comes, just like a lie,
you wear a mask and live on.</i>

22:53.330 --> 22:58.630
<i>I was wishing upon
the night stars...</i>

22:58.700 --> 23:03.970
<i>... for our distance
to become shorter.</i>

23:04.040 --> 23:10.680
<i>But if I try to bluff,
then I'm going to regret it.</i>

23:10.750 --> 23:13.220
<i>Words and feelings are reverse.</i>

23:13.280 --> 23:18.850
<i>Feelings that were asleep,
heart that was asleep, lure it out!</i>

23:18.920 --> 23:24.190
<i>Glamour that was asleep, myself
that was asleep, with your power!</i>

23:24.260 --> 23:29.720
<i>Please look at me quietly with the soul
that you cannot top more than this.</i>

23:29.800 --> 23:34.600
<i>I want you to go wilder inside me.</i>

23:34.670 --> 23:40.130
<i>Eyes that were asleep, emotions
that were asleep, wake them up!</i>

23:40.210 --> 23:45.480
<i>Memories that were asleep, dreams
that were asleep, with your power!</i>

23:45.550 --> 23:51.010
<i>Please melt me with the vision of kindness
that you cannot top more than this.</i>

23:51.090 --> 23:58.190
<i>I want to stay asleep
longer buried inside you.</i>

24:01.370 --> 24:04.960
The fragment of consciousness
that reaches across dimensions.

24:05.900 --> 24:09.460
That is the remains
of the grand ancient times.

24:11.180 --> 24:14.510
A small bend creates
an enormous distortion.

24:15.210 --> 24:17.410
The large time of decline...

24:17.950 --> 24:22.480
...turns our stronghold into
a reality beyond saving.

24:23.750 --> 24:29.860
<i>Episode 16, "Reunion"</i>

24:26.420 --> 24:28.890
Where are we headed?
